# Dockerfile-scoped ignore for the frontend production image (buildx reads
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the repo-root .dockerignore). It mirrors the root
# exclusions but RE-INCLUDES the prebuilt @eden/* library dist (libs/typescript/*/dist), which the
# frontend vite build consumes — the root .dockerignore strips **/dist, and this image needs those
# emitted artifacts (the libs' Svelte build toolchain is not reproducible in the lean build image, so
# the release workflow builds them in the devcontainer and ships the dist in — see the Dockerfile).
.git
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/.nx
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
docs/architecture/*.html
deploy/plane/local/.state

# Strip build outputs and dist by default …
**/dist
**/build
# … but KEEP the prebuilt @eden/* workspace-library dist the frontend consumes.
!libs/typescript/*/dist
!libs/typescript/*/dist/**

# SECRET SAFETY: never copy a real env file into a build context / image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
